{
  "version": "1.0",
  "description": "Weak-supervision rules, kept as data rather than code so a curator can edit them without touching the pipeline. They seed the graph and give the first model something to learn from; they are not the ontology itself. Property matching is driven mainly by the labels in properties.json — this file only adds terms the labels do not cover, and the ordered analysis rules.",
